WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.627 --> 00:00:04.463
When was the last time
that you did nothing?

00:00:05.589 --> 00:00:08.175
And by nothing,
I really mean nothing.

00:00:09.218 --> 00:00:11.261
Hi, I’m Andy,

00:00:11.345 --> 00:00:13.388
and welcome to
Headspace Guide to Meditation.

00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:16.058
Throughout this series,
I’m going to be your guide

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:17.684
as we explore the mind

00:00:17.768 --> 00:00:21.855
and discover how meditation
can benefit us in our life.

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:24.441
In each episode, I’m going
to introduce a new technique

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:29.071
and tell you how that technique
can be used for specific situations.

00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:31.532
I hope meditation can bring you

00:00:31.615 --> 00:00:35.118
a greater sense of presence
in your life,

00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:37.829
a greater ability
to not be distracted,

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:38.914
to enjoy life

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:42.125
and to connect with the people
that you care about most.

00:00:43.502 --> 00:00:46.922
The best way of experiencing
meditation is to actually do it,

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:48.465
not to just talk about it.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.842
We’re going to start
with the eyes open,

00:00:50.926 --> 00:00:54.805
and a nice, soft focus,
just aware of the space around you.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:58.141
And just take a moment,
before you do anything else…

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:01.812
just to appreciate
and enjoy that feeling

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:03.689
of having stopped.

